Description:	Improper access permissions for directory data-related files could allow unauthorized users to read, modify, or delete directory data or audit trails.

Satisfies: SRG-OS-000324-GPOS-00125, SRG-OS-000206-GPOS-00084
Check Text:	This applies to domain controllers. It is NA for other systems.

Run "Regedit".

Navigate to "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\NTDS\Parameters".

Note the directory locations in the values for:

Database log files path
